• **Satyarth Nayak** is the author of the book "**Sridevi: Girl Woman Superstar**," which is a comprehensive biography of the late actress Sridevi.

• The book chronicles Sridevi’s journey from her debut as a child artist to becoming one of the most iconic actresses in Indian cinema.

• It highlights her contribution to Indian cinema across multiple languages, including Tamil, Telugu, Kannada, Malayalam, and Hindi.

• The book is a tribute to Sridevi’s multifaceted persona, celebrating her legacy as a performer and a cultural icon.

• Satyarth Nayak, who is also a screenwriter and journalist, conducted extensive research and interviews to compile this well-documented biography.

